the 10.1.1.0/24 (host) and 10.200.0.0/24 (server) subnets. Ping from
host_1_1_1_1 to both web_server_0 and dns_server shows 0% packet loss. The
root cause of the ticket is a false premise: no failure has occurred.
The user's perception that the service is down is not supported by any
measurable network or application state. No corrective action is required.
